seems that you have a record linkage <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Record_linkage> problem on your hands.
I guess that the RecordLinkage <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RecordLinkage/index.html> package is a good place to start, but I am sure that there are solutions to this problem implemented in any language.
I would start by looking in the documentation of your DB.

